---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoOffCpuTimelineDemo from '../demos/GoOffCpuTimelineDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="goct-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Interactive lens: On-CPU pprof vs Off-CPU fgprof & go tool trace (50 ms request)" titleVi="Trình mô phỏng: So sánh góc nhìn CPU pprof (bỏ sót chờ I/O) với fgprof & go tool trace">
    <GoOffCpuTimelineDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Switch between Standard pprof CPU (seeing only 2 ms of JSON parsing while blind to 48 ms waiting on locks and Postgres), fgprof wall-clock profiling (exposing all 50 ms), and Mutex + execution trace diagnostics.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đổi qua lại giữa CPU pprof chuẩn (chỉ thấy đúng 2 ms parseJSON, mù hoàn toàn 48 ms đứng chờ khóa &amp; DB), fgprof bắt trọn 50 ms wall-clock và Mutex / Execution trace.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .goct-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .goct-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .goct-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .goct .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
  .goct .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .goct .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .goct .sd-stat b { font-size: 15px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }

  .goct-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .goct-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .goct-pane { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .goct-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .goct-code { padding: 8px 0; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .goct-line { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 12px; white-space: pre; color: var(--text-body); }
  .goct-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 22px; }
  .goct-line.is-active { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .goct-note { padding: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); }
  .goct-note p { margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
  .goct-bars { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .goct-bar-row { padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-alt); }
  .goct-bar-row.is-blind { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .goct-bar-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 4px; color: var(--text); }
  .goct-track { height: 7px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--border); overflow: hidden; }
  .goct-fill { height: 100%; background: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .goct-fill { background: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .goct-fill.is-mutex { background: var(--gold); }
  .goct-fill.is-io { background: var(--text-muted); }
  .goct-bar-row.is-blind .goct-fill { background: var(--red); }
</style>
